SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the SOFTWARE only:

    index.html   — but only its markup, styles and JavaScript
    css/         — all files
    js/          — all files
    tools/       — all files
    .github/     — all files
    agent/       — the Python agent code only: agent.py, main.py, tools.py,
                   grounding/__init__.py, grounding/normalize.py,
                   grounding/loader.py

It does NOT cover:

  * The COURSE CONTENT — lessons, exercises, vocabulary entries, reading
    texts, dialogues, grammar articles and their explanations, wherever they
    appear, including inside index.html. See LICENSE-CONTENT.

  * The AUDIO. The audio/ directory and the generated audio-manifest.js are
    not distributed with this repository and are not licensed by it. See
    docs/AUDIO.md.

  * The GROUNDING DATA under agent/grounding/*.json (vocab.json,
    grammar.json, verbs.json, gloss_index.json). It's the course content
    above, re-extracted as JSON for the agent to read: same terms as that
    content, see LICENSE-CONTENT, not this file.
